<title>USA: U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 10.035 million bushels of U.S. soybeans inspected for export in the week ended Oct 3 were for the following destinations (1,000 bushels):</p>
<p>Mississippi River to Belgium 1,297; Germany 1,318; Israel 527; Malaysia 1,415; Mexico 641; Netherlands 2,682; Romania 886 and Spain 882</p>
<p>Interior to Mexico 387</p>
</text>
